{title: Verasa Pogayile}
{artist: Jilla Imman}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] verasa pogayi [Am] le,        [A#] puthusa porava [Am] le
[F] ithu varaiyila kulir edukala,        [C] pennaala
[F] ava sirichathum thala oraiyuthu,        [C] thannaala
en [A#] pechu [C] moochu,        [Gm] enga [A] kaanaala
[Dm] Idhu naana enna,        [F] palasellaam enga
[Gm] pudhu sandhegangal,        [F] undag [Dm] udhu.
[Dm] indhu thindaatama,        [F] illa thallaatama
[Gm] manna vittu rendu,        [F] kaal [Dm] thaavudhu.
[Dm] eppothu [Bb] naan pogum,        [C] paadhai [F] idhu
[Bb] ippothu [F] nirkaamal,        [C] yen neeluthu
[A] en ullam lesaaga,        [Gm] kai neelu [A] thu
[Dm] verasa pogayi [Am] le,        [Dm] puthusa porava [Am] le
